{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"SUSE-SU-2025:03494-1","published":"2025-10-08T12:58:55Z","modified":"2026-03-23T04:49:58.562722Z","related":["CVE-2024-50154","CVE-2024-53168","CVE-2025-21692","CVE-2025-21791","CVE-2025-38089","CVE-2025-38477"],"upstream":["CVE-2024-50154","CVE-2024-53168","CVE-2025-21692","CVE-2025-21791","CVE-2025-38089","CVE-2025-38477"],"summary":"Security update for the Linux Kernel RT (Live Patch 3 for SLE 15 SP6)","details":"This update for the Linux Kernel 6.4.0-150600_10_11 fixes several issues.\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2025-38477: net/sched: sch_qfq: Fix race condition on qfq_aggregate (bsc#1247315).\n- CVE-2024-53168: sunrpc: fix one UAF issue caused by sunrpc kernel tcp socket (bsc#1243650).\n- CVE-2024-50154: tcp/dccp: Do not use timer_pending() in reqsk_queue_unlink() (bsc#1233072).\n- CVE-2025-21791: vrf: use RCU protection in l3mdev_l3_out() (bsc#1240744).\n- CVE-2025-38089: sunrpc: handle SVC_GARBAGE during svc auth processing as auth error (bsc#1245509).\n- CVE-2025-21692: net: sched: fix ets qdisc OOB Indexing (bsc#1237048).\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"kernel-livepatch-SLE15-SP6-RT_Update_3","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Live Patching 15 SP6","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/kernel-livepatch-SLE15-SP6-RT_Update_3&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Live%20Patching%2015%20SP6"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"18-150600.2.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"kernel-livepatch-6_4_0-150600_10_11-rt":"18-150600.2.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2025:03494-1.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.suse.com/support/update/announcement/2025/suse-su-202503494-1/"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1233072"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1237048"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1240744"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1